Oath. In certain cases, an oath would clear a person. Ex. xxii. 11. Solomon prays that perjury may be disclosed. --- Altar. It was customary to touch the altar, when a person took an oath, as Hannibal did. K. Latinus says;

Tango aras mediosque ignes et Numina testor---

Nulla dies pacem hanc Italis nec fœdera rumpet.---Æn. xii. 201.
